{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SPIN Protocol, your goal is clear: redirect signals to activate every Receiver Node with the correct color. But don\u2019t be fooled- the path to victory is rarely straightforward...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Signals of different colors cannot mix or cross, and sometimes the most obvious path is not the correct one:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif1.gif?t=1742346638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, new types of nodes are introduced. Fusion Nodes can mix two colors to create a new one:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif2.gif?t=1742346638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bridge Nodes allow signals to cross paths without interference:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif3.gif?t=1742346638\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and much, much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For perfectionists, merely solving a level might not be enough. Earn a perfect score by completing levels within the time and rotation limits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif4.gif?t=1742346638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 60 levels of increasing difficulty, SPIN Protocol offers a satisfying blend of simplicity and depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effortless controls:</strong> Rotate nodes with a single button, fully playable with either a mouse, keyboard or controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 60 handcrafted levels:</strong> With each new circuit, you'll face new challenges. As you progress and discover new game mechanics, these levels will become more complex and intricate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalistic  aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a clean, retro-futuristic visual and audio design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multi-language support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/a77aa72193e3a512f2308637a6c505944c8e8a33.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/dad60f740f1fb8b23836282d7195e19f751522d6.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/8d1b253209a25c74b53a0a5ee101872eb47f8238.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/4d5283d792ff2a2bbc15fe65fb6afde9dbdb19b0.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/76bb5aa6070cb73f7fafd3a8b5f16f10b5184632.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 6 Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/eb5fe2195804941934934da836842f673306ef13.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1 Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/d8945490f93cdff15574cec96189325e30401bb2.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342810/a2e2fa8e257a5348588352e83b2318c53b034e96.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3 Master","path":"https://cdn.a