ore_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif2.gif?t=1742346638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bridge Nodes allow signals to cross paths without interference:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif3.gif?t=1742346638\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and much, much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For perfectionists, merely solving a level might not be enough. Earn a perfect score by completing levels within the time and rotation limits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342810/extras/a0_gif4.gif?t=1742346638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 60 levels of increasing difficulty, SPIN Protocol offers a satisfying blend of simplicity and depth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effortless controls:</strong> Rotate nodes with a single button, fully playable with either a mouse, keyboard or controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 60 handcrafted levels:</strong> With each new circuit, you'll face new challenges. As you progress and discover new game mechanics, these levels will become more complex and intricate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalistic  aesthetic:</strong> Immerse yourself in a clean, retro-futuristic visual and audio design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multi-language support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Diego Spartano","Sebastian Spartano"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams